,"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 49% of normal in July to August and 43% of normal in November to December. Grid 17258 had its driest year in 1954, at 61% of normal.</p>"}
